flowchart LR
    A[Raw basketball CSV] --> B[Schema validation]
    B --> C[Feature engineering]

    C --> D[MP string to numeric minutes]
    D --> E[Sort by Player + Date]
    E --> F[Shift PTS by one game]
    F --> G[Create target: PTS_next]

    G --> H[Select features<br/>MIN_float, FGA, 3PA, FTA, ORB, DRB, AST, STL, BLK, TOV, PF]
    H --> I[Time-ordered train/test split]

    I --> J[Baseline: next = current points]
    I --> K[LinearRegression]

    K --> L[Predictions on test set]
    J --> M[Baseline metrics]
    L --> N[Model metrics]

    K --> O[Raw coefficients]
    H --> P[StandardScaler]
    P --> Q[Standardized LinearRegression]
    Q --> R[Standardized coefficients]

    M --> S[metrics.json]
    N --> S
    O --> T[coefficients.csv]
    R --> T

    L --> U[parity_plot.png]
    L --> V[residuals.png]
    R --> W[feature_importance.png]